WEBVTT

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.910
Have you forgotten...

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:49.550
...about the red kerchief?

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:53.050
They got in the kiddy bath!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:59.060
<b>The Bathhouse, Where You're 
Naked in Body and Soul</b>

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:05.070
Huh? Why?

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:06.270
Why?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:09.070
Why did these giants 
get in the kiddy bath?

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.770
U-Uh...

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:14.130
The adult bath is warmer 
and more comfortable.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:14.700
Oh...

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.870
Actually, our race 
can't stand hot water.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.580
We only bathe in cold water.

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.580
We'd love to use the cold bath
over there but it's too small for us.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.360
We made the wrong choice!

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:27.090
We should have gotten in the adult bath!

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.730
Hey! We're completely surrounded!

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:32.420
Like an innocent bystander in the 
middle of a bunch of burly, tattooed men!

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.670
Dude, they're watching us!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.470
They're staring at us!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.600
What do we do?! We can't get out!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.410
How is the water, Dad?

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.660
Too warm!

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.930
This is what the Edo folk are used to?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.110
I'd prefer cold water that 
makes you shiver good.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.550
Our dad is a traditional Dakini.

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:52.110
But it's true that the 
water is a little lukewarm.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:56.230
Um, we were just saying how 
the water was too warm.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.250
Want me to add some cold water?

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.240
Oh, no. There's no need for that.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:03.430
I brought an iceberg just 
in case this happened.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:07.470
That's our Brother Hedoro!

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:08.500
He's always prepared.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.250
This ice water is perfect.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.860
Y-You bet!

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.760
It gives you a real kick!

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.620
How cold do they need their water?!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:18.760
We aren't seals!

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:20.890
My lips are turning purple!

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.140
I'm gonna freeze to 
death! Freeze to death!

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.740
Hey! Someone get us out of here!

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:26.710
No!

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:30.400
They'll think that we don't 
like their ice-cold water!

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.530
Damn, I'm getting sleepy.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.150
Don't go to sleep! You'll die!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.660
Papa, can I get out?

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.020
That's it!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.380
Kids hate long baths!

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:40.910
We'll use this chance to...!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.610
Absolutely not!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:48.300
You must stay in the bath 
for at least ten minutes.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:52.550
Otherwise you won't be able to 
wash away the sweat and grime.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.730
Look.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.600
Follow the example of these young men.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.760
They're even washing their heads.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.370
Goro, you need to do a 
better job of raising him.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.500
Sorry, Brother.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.780
I can't stop spoiling him.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.060
Ten minutes?!

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:08.060
If we stay in this freezing water 
for ten minutes, we'll be dead!

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:09.440
No more!

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:13.190
My dick has shrunk to the point where 
it looks like I have three balls.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.820
Wait, yours was always that small.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.570
It's going to completely disappear!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.100
Either way, we're dead.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.840
Hijikata-san, you lead the way.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:21.660
Screw that!

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.730
I'll do whatever it takes 
to live longer than you!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.580
You go!

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:28.480
Then the person who runs out of breath 
first gets to take one for the team.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.700
That settles it!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.970
Hey, that's dirty!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:32.840
You go!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:33.750
You!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.010
You!

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.340
Bastard!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.930
Hey! This isn't the time to 
be fighting amongst ourselves!

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.420
I refuse to go!

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:45.550
Hey! Hold on!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.730
What are you holding on to?

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.120
Hey! Why are you holding that?!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:00.940
And that geezer's balls really sag!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.560
Let go! Quick!

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.510
N-No!

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:04.620
I can't move my fingers! 
They're frozen stiff!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.560
Hey, surface and make 
up some kind of excuse!

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:08.910
We'll deal with the situation down here.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.040
What kind of excuse do you want?!

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:17.120
Y-Yeah, this is such a nice bath.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.040
What were you doing underwater?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.510
Oh, we were holding a 
little diving contest.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:24.550
It's all the rage these days.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.060
Damn, I lost!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:30.120
Earthlings are such fun.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.620
Hm? Is something wrong, Dad?

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:36.020
Hm, my crotch feels strange.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:36.570
Huh?

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:39.910
O-Oh, it must be a side 
effect of the water!

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:40.930
A side effect of the water?

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.360
Yes, you know?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.510
Right, Mr. Make-up-an-excuse?

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.700
Why don't you explain it to them?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.330
What?!

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:53.060
I-In fact, the water in this bath 
is drawn from an underground spring

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.000
known as the Biagra Spring.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.690
The Biagra Spring?

00:05:56.690 --> 00:06:00.590
It's excellent for improving 
your health and sexual drive!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.140
Oh, I see.

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:06.100
That's why it feels like 
something's tugging on my junk.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:11.230
I-I'm sure that you'll feel like 
a young man once you're done here.

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:13.600
Oh, that sounds like a challenge.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.510
Honey, let's try for number six tonight!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.580
Oh, please.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.310
Come on, Dad.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:25.910
Huh?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:26.600
Dad?

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.880
Your dad must be really excited.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.600
He's joining in the diving contest.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.150
Oh, I see.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:36.110
But I see a lot of bubbles.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:36.820
Oh, his hand.

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:38.600
He seems to be struggling...

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:39.540
I-It's a V!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.490
He's signaling V for victory!

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.350
It's too easy!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.220
Oh, he was signaling a V.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.760
Oh, somebody's come up for a breath!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.430
Hel...

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.730
He just asked for help...

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:56.290
Uh, it's obvious that something's 
