00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.100
Nothing's happening! 
Nothing's happening at all!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.620
Th-They're just playing around.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.150
Those guys are such jokers.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.420
Hey, Jiro.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.880
Take a look down there.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:04.550
Y-Yes.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.570
Hold on!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.430
Nothing's happening!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.780
Everything's okay!

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.120
Oh, there he is.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.200
We were worried, Dad.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.190
Are you okay?

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.190
Sorry, sorry.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:16.700
I ran into this giant squid underwater.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.290
Man, I thought I was finished.

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:20.800
Uh, we're definitely finished now!

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.550
Huh? Wait, who are you?

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.800
Huh? Wh-What are you talking 
about? I'm your dad.

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:26.130
No, no, no.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.930
You can't fool them like that!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:30.860
Oh, it must be the Biagra Spring.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.810
He's young again. That's awesome.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.310
Impossible! They're not gonna buy it!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.270
What?

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:37.910
R-Really?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.470
You look like a completely 
different person.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:41.820
What?! You've forgotten how 
your own father looks?!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:47.140
Honey, let's forget about these 
heartless jerks and make a new kid!

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.900
She's ignoring him!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.380
She knows the truth!

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.670
A-Anyway, it's time to get out.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.730
I'm feeling a bit chilly 
after the long bath.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:58.330
Wait a moment, Dad.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.450
Something's dangling from your crotch.

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:04.840
Dad is dangling from dad!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:05.830
What are you talking about?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.530
That's just my ball sack.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:09.280
Your ball sack?

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.200
It looks exactly like your former self.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.750
It's just a ball sack.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.590
Look at the wrinkles.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.810
It's become bloated after 
sitting in the water.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:18.370
C-Come to think of it, I've never 
seen your ball sack before.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.730
So this is your ball sack?

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.860
Of course not!

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:26.200
Gi-Gin-san!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.310
We've got no choice.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.010
They got stuck together.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:30.370
We'll just have to ride out 
the storm on this story.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.610
Is that even possible?!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.300
We're supposed to 
weather the stormy seas

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:36.070
with that heavy anchor 
dangling from our boat?!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.470
Yeah, it's not happening.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:48.190
What do we do?

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:50.470
We should apologize before 
they figure out what happened.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.460
Apologize?

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:55.520
For getting tangled up in 
their old man's ball sack

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:58.260
and treating him like a ball sack?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:04.520
If we do that, we'll be murdered 
by the family of demons!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.010
We'll have to trust him.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:09.280
He'll make it work somehow.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.920
All we can do is pray.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:12.950
I pray for our success.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:13.740
Wait a second!

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:17.190
Don't just spit out 
cliches and run away!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:18.900
Do something about Kondo-san!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.680
What?

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:22.430
It's his own fault for getting 
tangled in the ball sack!

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.750
What are you arguing about?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.890
Did you forget your shampoo?

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:30.050
I can lend you my Temote.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.630
N-No, I prefer Tsubakiki.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.290
I go for Vidal Hahhoon.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:38.060
Uh, I think I stayed in the bath 
too long, so I'd like to get going.

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:41.420
What? You haven't washed your body yet.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:44.750
Are you trying to be considerate 
and give our family some space?

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:45.920
No, that's not it.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.320
I'm terribly sorry.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:51.570
We were the ones who barged in 
on the bath you had reserved.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.740
Please allow us to wash your backs.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.580
I cannot leave before I've 
shown my appreciation.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.080
He wants to show his appreciation...

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.080
He won't let us leave 
until he's gotten revenge.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.590
Jiro, Saburo.

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.090
Shiro, Goro.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.970
We're going to wash their backs.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.470
N-No, no, no!

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:14.010
N-No, thanks!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:16.420
We can wash ourselves!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.200
That's right.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.860
When someone stands behind me, 
I get the urge to beat him down.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:21.690
Hey! Stop making threats!

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.980
This isn't the time to let 
your sadistic side take over!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:27.250
Yeah! Let them wash your backs!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.990
That's enough out of 
you, Grandpa Ball-Sack!

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:34.490
The gorilla is killing 
our chance to escape!

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:37.490
I'll wash Dad's back.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.900
Let me know if there are 
any spots that itch.

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.340
This brings back memories.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:44.250
When you were little, you 
used to wash my back for me.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.300
You would always get mad.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.300
You would yell at me to wash harder.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:53.010
Dad! What's wrong?!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:56.410
His skin has peeled off, Brother Hedoro!

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:57.330
Impossible!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:01.050
