nails to wash himself!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.980
When did he become so weak?

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:06.520
Maybe this isn't Dad?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:09.060
I-It must be, you know...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.570
The soap. He must be 
allergic to the soap.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:16.090
Would he start gushing blood 
because he's allergic to the soap?

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.170
The soap on Earth is really acidic,

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.290
so you have to be careful 
or your body will dissolve!

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.960
Really...

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.540
I'm sorry, Dad.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.720
I-It must be hard when you don't 
know anything about this place.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.920
We'll teach you the Earth 
way of taking a bath,

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:31.430
so please have a seat!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:37.060
Earthlings are so kind.

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:39.250
They allowed us in the bath that 
they had previously reserved,

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.560
and they're even offering 
to wash our backs.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.970
Thank you very much.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.630
I promise to return the favor.

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:50.070
N-No, we just want you to 
enjoy your stay on Earth.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.760
Hey! Why are we doing this?!

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:54.890
It beats having the skin 
ripped off our backs!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:58.740
Washing their backs 
is just as dangerous!

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:00.840
But we can prevent any further damage

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:04.580
to Kondo-san by teaching 
them how we clean.

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:09.270
Let us learn how they wash 
their bodies in Edo, Dad.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:10.150
See?

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.940
We need to be really delicate,

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:14.090
'cause Kondo-san's body can't take much more.

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:15.440
That settles it.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:16.870
Now, Hedoro-san.

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:18.340
Do as I do.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.300
First, you must have a gentle mindset.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.470
The soap on Earth is strong,

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:27.600
so the softest of sponges 
can still hurt your body.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:31.510
First, we add lotion to the 
water to make it smoother.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:32.610
What kind of bath are we talking about?!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.480
We don't need to teach them how to

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.480
