00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.660
I don't frequent them!

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.340
If the water is slimy enough,

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.620
nobody will notice when 
there's an accident!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.290
What kind of accident?!

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.620
Your mind is a pile of slime!

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:47.120
So you're a fan, boss.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.130
And he already slimed him!

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:53.630
Huh, he's smoking?

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.650
My body is on fire!

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:59.130
Wh-What did you do?!

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.730
What is this?!

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:02.640
They're all in pain, Gin-san!

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.330
This is bad, chief.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.920
It looks like their weakness is lotion.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:07.640
What?!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.650
Their weakness is lotion?

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.900
Sure, most guys have a weakness for lotion!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:17.280
Lotion is getting in my wounds!

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:18.150
Say, Odd Jobs. Is everything okay?

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:19.900
E-Everything is fine!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.140
This liquid kills germs.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.630
The pain means that the germs are dying!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:28.120
B-But we should probably wash it off.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.210
Hey! Pour water on them!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.290
Wash off the lotion!

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.260
Wh-What do you think you're doing?!

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.460
Wh-Who poured lotion 
all over the floor?!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.590
You did!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.520
Chief, am I doing it right?

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:46.220
You don't have to copy him!

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.640
Hijikata-san, we have no choice!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.470
Act like this is how we bathe in Edo!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.330
Hell no!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.030
If you don't, you'll end up like him.

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:58.610
Odd Jobs, are you sure this is 
the proper way to apply water?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:00.620
It's fine.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.240
This is how we bathe in Edo.

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:05.940
You Edo folk are amazing.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:09.350
You torture yourselves 
when you take a bath?

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.000
Pretty much!

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.750
It's like a form of training!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.940
I'm very impressed by you samurai.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:19.970
I wouldn't be able to 
stand this treatment.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:22.850
H-He's running out of patience?!

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:25.440
Any more and he'll kill us all!

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:28.720
I can't trust this guy with our lives!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:31.190
I'll take over then.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:34.230
I have to make up for all 
the previous failures.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.960
First, we pull the head out of the wall

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.660
and wash it with lukewarm wate-

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.640
Wate-

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:45.240
H-He won't come out!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.640
Wate-

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:53.750
But you're actually trying to 
impale your forehead on the horns.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.250
Even Hijikata-san screwed up!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.820
Huh? Why would you do that?

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:03.610
This is how we make amends 
for the previous step.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:05.260
Yeah, isn't that right?

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:09.260
No, I've never heard that before.

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:10.070
Huh?

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:13.000
That's not how we bathe in Edo.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:16.480
The bastard is ignoring my mistake?!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.750
That's bullshit!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.780
I've been saving your 
ass this whole time!

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.590
No, think long and hard.

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:22.860
You've done this before.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:23.720
No, I haven't.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.740
I guarantee it.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.260
Why would I want to do that?

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.270
Could you stop?

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:30.710
It's pretty disgusting to try to pass 
off your mistake as an Edo tradition.

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.600
Then what the hell have you 
been doing this whole time?!

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.790
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:36.110
Man, this is bad!

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:37.790
He's figured out that something's wrong!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.990
Huh? You don't follow this practice?

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:44.300
Everybody in the Shinsengumi does.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:45.570
Sogo...

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.300
You're helping me?

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.660
Watch this.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.810
You aim for the center...

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:51.930
Like this!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.430
Why me?!

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:57.350
I was wondering why he 
would jump to my rescue.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.770
Now I see why!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.380
In that case...

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:08.450
Do these people even realize 
that we're in a bathhouse?!

00:16:08.450 --> 00:16:10.260
This has nothing to do 
with bathing anymore!

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.750
And why are the Hedoro brothers 
letting you do this?!

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:18.380
I see, there are many 
different practices in Edo.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.730
Gin-san! Kondo-san!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:25.160
Th-That's a barbaric practice that was 
introduced by some country bumpkins!

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.950
You don't need to follow it!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.460
Oh, really. That's good.

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:33.000
Since the practice would 
damage our precious horns.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:33.560
Horns?

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:40.240
Yes, for the Dakini, our horns are 
almost as important as our lives.

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:42.330
One represents our pride.

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:45.070
The other represents our soul.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:50.070
If our horns are damaged, our 
pride and soul are tarnished.

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.480
The soul of a Dakini...

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.580
...is stuck in the dirtiest 
place in this world!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.940
Pull it out before they notice!

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:02.160
It's no use! It's completely stuck!

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:05.050
Kondo-san's rectal 
muscles are superhuman.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.340
Let me handle this!

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.220
Why did you snap them?!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:10.970
Saburo...

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.470
Your horns...

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:14.970
Is something wrong with his horns?!

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.180
Well, Saburo's horns appear to be...

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.230
Huh? They're fine.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:20.340
That's odd...

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.530
I could have sworn that...

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.360
I-It must have been your imagination.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.860
You stuck them in upside-down!

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.740
You stabbed them right into his head!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.490
Anyway, it was tough 
getting those horns out.

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.990
Huh? They're still there.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:34.140
I snapped Shiro's horns off 
and stuck them on Saburo.

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:36.140
That doesn't help anything!

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.060
Now Shiro's missing his horns!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.420
We'll have to snap off 
Goro's horns next.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.500
Will it ever end?!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.720
Then we'll take one horn each from 
Goro and Jiro to stick on Shiro.

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:46.160
That's not the issue!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.120
You're just making it worse!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:48.970
What about the sixth one?

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:50.110
There isn't a sixth brother!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.470
We only have five to work with!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.750
Hey, Saburo, Shiro.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:54.820
And Dad.

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:58.020
If you fool around too much, 
your precious horns will be...

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.020
Shiro! Your horns!

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.040
Is something wrong with his horns?!

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:04.070
Now he docked them together!

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.530
Well, Shiro's horns appear to be...

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:07.430
Huh? They're fine.

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:10.550
Wait, there's two of them, so 
there should be four horns...

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:11.430
Now...

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:13.810
There are four horns.

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:15.530
Those are completely different horns!

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.190
Oh, that's a relief.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:18.720
It appears that they're safe.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:20.060
How can he believe this crap?!

00:18:20.060 --> 00:18:21.520
Such strong horns...

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.690
In that case, there's nothing

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:25.040
wrong with the horns that 
are stuck in his ass.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.360
Okay, that's enough preparation.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:28.880
It's time to wash your backs.

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.550
I'm too scared to go near them.

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:34.800
<b>Kiddy Bath
Do not jump in.</b>

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.940
We just need to throw them in the bath?

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.930
Yeah, like this.

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:36.800
Hey!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.240
That's not how you wash someone's back!

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.810
That's how you dispose of a body!

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:44.860
Th-That's...

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.090
Dad's ball sack has surfaced!

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:48.820
You're wrong!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.110
Don't call me a ball sack!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.820
Huh? That means you've 
returned to your former self.

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:59.080
H-How did you enjoy your stay on Earth?

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.830
Was it fun?

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.690
Hell no!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:05.830
It was a terrible experience!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.470
D-Damn, he's pissed!

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:09.520
Of course he is.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.310
We were calling him a ball sack.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:11.860
We're dead!

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:12.840
For sure!

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:16.030
I-I'm very sorry, Dad.

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:18.850
You didn't like Edo.

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:25.600
I didn't come here so you could 
show the family the sights.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:30.730
I wanted to see if you were 
living a proper life in Edo.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:35.200
When you were little, you 
spent your days alone

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:39.120
because your appearance 
scared everyone off.

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:44.620
So I wanted to see that you weren't 
alone on this distant planet.

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:48.380
It was a terrible experience.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:50.540
I have a bad impression of Edo.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.630
But that doesn't matter.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:57.500
Because I met some friendly 
people who tried their best

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:00.140
to make me welcome.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:07.150
Hedoro, you've found some good friends.

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:13.940
Everyone...

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:17.310
Please continue to be 
friends with our brother.

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.160
Please!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.000
E-Everyone...

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:27.600
I guess we misunderstood 
their intentions.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:35.610
A scary family?

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.680
I'd say they're a pretty nice family.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:42.180
We shouldn't bother them.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.930
Let's make ourselves scarce then.

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.940
Oh! Please wait!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.680
I would like to thank you!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.540
No, that won't be necessary.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.700
Well, boys?

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:57.200
Let's show our appreciation 
in an Edo fashion.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.030
I like the sound of that.

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:02.620
We'll do for them everything 
they've done for us.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:06.120
Come over here, guys.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:11.760
It's our turn to wash 
your backs Edo-style.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:16.630
<b>Greater Edo Bath</b>

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:16.630
When I said we should leave together,

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:21.640
I was always the one who had to wait.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:26.480
Until my wet hair dried,

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:31.670
and my soap became hard.

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:36.220
You would embrace me,

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:40.850
and say that it was cold.

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:39.610
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:31.800
Lady!

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:34.450
After hearing that you will 
be the star next week,

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:38.240
I became as excited as a ****** ** ****!

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:39.050
Shut up.

00:23:39.050 --> 00:23:40.160
Yes, ma'am.

00:23:39.610 --> 00:23:44.950
<b>Jugem</b>

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:40.900
Next time:

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:41.830
Jugem.

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:43.600
If you don't understand the title,

00:23:43.600 --> 00:23:44.950
you should do some research.
